data: {"event":"message","conversation_id":"a78acffe-9519-46db-bed1-b6812a3ff391","message_id":"ce402e2f-481b-43fa-9a74-867b357b65a3","created_at":1793605896,"task_id":"6812f748-2cf8-49a6-93ee-a95247a125d4","id":"ce402e2f-481b-43fa-9a74-867b357b65a3","answer":"· 玩家【通缉演示三】对老周做了：把一只假蟑螂塞进老周的杯垫底下。老周的反应：老周怒瞪你一眼，把假蟑螂踢到你脚边，嘴里骂道：。怒气+3。\n· 玩家把招牌菜喂给黄狗，老周怒气冲冲，怒气 +4\n· 玩家偷偷把老周的招牌酒换成兑水的假酒，老周怒气冲天，要求玩家重新酿制（怒气 +5）\n· 老周被辣得直咳嗽，记下了这次恶作剧（怒气 +3）\n· 玩家把糖罐和盐罐对调，让整晚的甜酒都变咸，老周怒气 +3。\n· 玩家锯短了老周常坐的藤椅一条腿，老周把小桌掀翻，怒气 +5。","from_variable_selector":["parse_recall","ledger"]}

data: {"event":"node_finished","conversation_id":"a78acffe-9519-46db-bed1-b6812a3ff391","message_id":"ce402e2f-481b-43fa-9a74-867b357b65a3","created_at":1793605896,"task_id":"6812f748-2cf8-49a6-93ee-a95247a125d4","workflow_run_id":"5992c4a8-e969-4602-bbd8-6b3bd5470415","data":{"id":"1a6a58d4-8c62-46d3-987d-57d9d11f7ddd","node_id":"parse_llm","node_type":"code","title":"解析老周的反应","index":9,"predecessor_node_id":null,"inputs":{"raw":"老周怒目圆睁，指着你大喝：“你小子敢动我的账本！给我补回来！”一巴掌拍在桌子上，震得杯盘乱响。怒气+5。{\"reply\":\"老周怒目圆睁，指着你大喝：‘你小子敢动我的账本！给我补回来！’一巴掌拍在桌子上，震得杯盘乱响。\",\"verdict\":\"暴怒\",\"grudge_delta\":5,\"memory\":\"玩家撕掉了老周记账本的三页纸，老周怒气冲天要求赔偿。\"}","player":"通缉演示三","action":"撕掉老周记账本的三页纸","grudge_total":23,"knowledge":[{"metadata":{"_source":"knowledge","dataset_id":"08e2abca-e168-42ee-9cf1-85036e3066e9","dataset_name":"记仇酒馆·恶作剧图鉴","document_id":"da8a49c0-7b4a-4bf3-9786-1f21cee9e875","document_name":"prank_compendium.md","data_source_type":"upload_file","segment_id":"2d50d324-45bc-43e2-8c6f-e9c92b2fb96c","retriever_from":"workflow","score":0.513096572041554,"child_chunks":[],"segment_hit_count":5,"segment_word_count":161,"segment_position":10,"segment_index_node_hash":"a974d31ca54f296dc256b0e98dd787f5749f37b50405b719e1673c92b79bbdd0","doc_metadata":null,"position":1},"title":"prank_compendium.md","files":null,"content":"老周的记仇规则\n- 老周嘴上说“没事”，心里有一本账。\n- 同一招用第二次，怒气翻倍；换新招，怒气按危险度计算。\n- 怒气累计到 8 以上，老周会主动报复；累计到 15 以上，他会把你的名字写进“酒馆通缉令”。\n- 道歉并请全场喝一轮，可以减 3 点怒气，但老周会记住“你心虚了”。\n- 老周最怕的不是恶作剧，是你不来了。","summary":null},{"metadata":{"_source":"knowledge","dataset_id":"08e2abca-e168-42ee-9cf1-85036e3066e9","dataset_name":"记仇酒馆·恶作剧图鉴","document_id":"da8a49c0-7b4a-4bf3-9786-1f21cee9e875","document_name":"prank_compendium.md","data_source_type":"upload_file","segment_id":"7b31dfb4-6c7f-44f1-a441-0801cd964b8f","retriever_from":"workflow","score":0.5094282925221841,"child_chunks":[],"segment_hit_count":35,"segment_word_count":166,"segment_position":6,"segment_index_node_hash":"7976c0c6f6f32b9cf80253849a061ae544741c521dc7776b66c217c1c442c6f3","doc_metadata":null,"position":2},"title":"prank_compendium.md","files":null,"content":"胶水杯底\n- 招式名：胶水粘杯底\n- 操作方式：在老周常用的玻璃杯底涂一层强力胶，粘在吧台上。\n- 预期效果：老周端杯子时端不动，用力一扯把杯子扯碎。\n- 老周的反应：盯着杯底看半天，认出是你干的，默默换了个不锈钢杯。\n- 反制手段：之后给你上的酒一律用缺口的旧杯子，说是“配套”。\n- 危险度：★★★（可能割伤手，属于重点记仇项）","summary":null},{"metadata":{"_source":"knowledge","dataset_id":"08e2abca-e168-42ee-9cf1-85036e3066e9","dataset_name":"记仇酒馆·恶作剧图鉴","document_id":"da8a49c0-7b4a-4bf3-9786-1f21cee9e875","document_name":"prank_compendium.md","data_source_type":"upload_file","segment_id":"75ff2e74-b4e8-4fbe-bcae-19c15c613414","retriever_from":"workflow","score":0.5069931713803019,"child_chunks":[],"segment_hit_count":4,"segment_word_count":67,"segment_position":1,"segment_index_node_hash":"1e4d9b7ca4502f518eba1359b9016ba210a429a6b32b003ff23afcb3f979c2da","doc_metadata":null,"position":3},"title":"prank_compendium.md","files":null,"content":"记仇酒馆·恶作剧图鉴\n本图鉴收录酒馆常客对老板老周用过的恶作剧招式。每条包含招式名、操作方式、预期效果、老周的反应与反制手段、危险度。","summary":null}]},"inputs_truncated":false,"process_data":{},"process_data_truncated":false,"outputs":{"delta":5,"new_total":28,"reply":"老周怒目圆睁，指着你大喝：‘你小子敢动我的账本！给我补回来！’一巴掌拍在桌子上，震得杯盘乱响。","verdict":"暴怒","threat":"通缉令","memory_text":"玩家撕掉了老周记账本的三页纸，老周怒气冲天要求赔偿（怒气 +5）","kb_titles":"prank_compendium.md"},"outputs_truncated":false,"status":"succeeded","error":null,"elapsed_time":0.055151,"execution_metadata":null,"created_at":1793605897,"finished_at":1793605898,"files":[],"iteration_id":null,"loop_id":null}}

