data: {"event":"message_end","conversation_id":"a78acffe-9519-46db-bed1-b6812a3ff391","message_id":"ce402e2f-481b-43fa-9a74-867b357b65a3","created_at":1793605896,"task_id":"6812f748-2cf8-49a6-93ee-a95247a125d4","id":"ce402e2f-481b-43fa-9a74-867b357b65a3","metadata":{"annotation_reply":null,"retriever_resources":[{"knowledge_fs_citation":null,"position":1,"dataset_id":"08e2abca-e168-42ee-9cf1-85036e3066e9","dataset_name":"记仇酒馆·恶作剧图鉴","document_id":"da8a49c0-7b4a-4bf3-9786-1f21cee9e875","document_asset_id":null,"document_name":"prank_compendium.md","document_revision":null,"document_version":null,"data_source_type":"upload_file","segment_id":"2d50d324-45bc-43e2-8c6f-e9c92b2fb96c","retriever_from":"workflow","score":0.513096572041554,"hit_count":5,"word_count":161,"segment_position":10,"index_node_hash":"a974d31ca54f296dc256b0e98dd787f5749f37b50405b719e1673c92b79bbdd0","content":"老周的记仇规则\n- 老周嘴上说“没事”，心里有一本账。\n- 同一招用第二次，怒气翻倍；换新招，怒气按危险度计算。\n- 怒气累计到 8 以上，老周会主动报复；累计到 15 以上，他会把你的名字写进“酒馆通缉令”。\n- 道歉并请全场喝一轮，可以减 3 点怒气，但老周会记住“你心虚了”。\n- 老周最怕的不是恶作剧，是你不来了。","page":null,"doc_metadata":null,"title":null,"files":null,"summary":null},{"knowledge_fs_citation":null,"position":2,"dataset_id":"08e2abca-e168-42ee-9cf1-85036e3066e9","dataset_name":"记仇酒馆·恶作剧图鉴","document_id":"da8a49c0-7b4a-4bf3-9786-1f21cee9e875","document_asset_id":null,"document_name":"prank_compendium.md","document_revision":null,"document_version":null,"data_source_type":"upload_file","segment_id":"7b31dfb4-6c7f-44f1-a441-0801cd964b8f","retriever_from":"workflow","score":0.5094282925221841,"hit_count":35,"word_count":166,"segment_position":6,"index_node_hash":"7976c0c6f6f32b9cf80253849a061ae544741c521dc7776b66c217c1c442c6f3","content":"胶水杯底\n- 招式名：胶水粘杯底\n- 操作方式：在老周常用的玻璃杯底涂一层强力胶，粘在吧台上。\n- 预期效果：老周端杯子时端不动，用力一扯把杯子扯碎。\n- 老周的反应：盯着杯底看半天，认出是你干的，默默换了个不锈钢杯。\n- 反制手段：之后给你上的酒一律用缺口的旧杯子，说是“配套”。\n- 危险度：★★★（可能割伤手，属于重点记仇项）","page":null,"doc_metadata":null,"title":null,"files":null,"summary":null},{"knowledge_fs_citation":null,"position":3,